      "text": "Fig 18, 'Architecture based on supply chain design: decentralized management (option A)'. The same services and interoperability layer, with the health supply chain information systems split in two: at national level forecasting and planning, procurement, supplier and contract, transportation, warehouse and cold chain management; at facility level order management, dispensing, inventory and cold chain management.",
